<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 409)</h2>
<p><b>Licensing that stays out of your way.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Asobi Review stays licensed while it's part of reviews — every invitation, session join, or license file renews it. A copy that goes a month without one pauses and asks for a key; any current invite or review link brings it straight back, notes untouched. Long-term licenses are available from Autonomy.</li>
</ul>
